me_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4181040-1842846814440427","game_id":"steam-4181040","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.1.9 Patch Notes","summary":"- Added new main objective types, including Demon Onslaught, Shadow Ambush, Thunder Prison, and more. - Adjusted enemy configurations. - Fixed several item-related issues. - Fixed a misaligned Reshape icon. - Added more stats to the Stats panel. - Clicking a distant node in the Talent Tree now automatically unlocks nodes along the shortest available path. - Improved early-game loot progression and increased late-game power. - Added an Overlay Map Opacity setting to the Settings menu. - Fixed an ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T14:02:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440427","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4181040-1842212951310059","game_id":"steam-4181040","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.1.7 Patch Notes","summary":"Fixed an issue where a computer crash during save writing could corrupt the save file.Reduced the difficulty in the early game, increased the difficulty in the late game, and increased late-game drop rates.Adjusted the effects of several talent tree nodes.Reduced enemy movement speed in the Snow Mountain area.Fixed an issue that could cause bosses to become invincible under certain circumstances.Increased the power of several skill tree nodes.Adjusted the effects of several items.Fixed an issue ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T12:25:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4181040-1842212951307296","game_id":"steam-4181040","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.1.5 Patch Notes","summary":"The Demo's difficulty progression still needs more testing. If you run into any noticeable difficulty spikes, areas where progression feels blocked, or sections that feel too easy, please let me know. I'll continue testing and adjusting the balance.Fixed an issue where some Skill Tree node descriptions displayed values as 0Adjusted equipment affix weights: Damage, Health, and Shield affixes will now appear more frequently. Since the game does not use the guaranteed stat systems commonly found on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T10:10:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951307296","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4181040-1842212951305241","game_id":"steam-4181040","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Now Available! Begin Your Journey of Cultivation","summary":"Hello everyone!The Steam Demo is now officially available. Feel free to download it and give it a try!The Demo is still being actively developed and improved, so you may encounter bugs, balance issues, or other rough edges. Any feedback or suggestions are greatly appreciated.Feedback & Contact:Email: kakurbtree@gmail.comX (Twitter): https://x.com/ka_ku43362If you encounter a bug, screenshots and a short description of what happened and how to reproduce it would be especially helpful.If you enjoy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T09:01:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305241","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:46Z","discovery_method":"of